# patches/*.patch are diffs of openwakeword/ files, which use CRLF line endings
# upstream. The diff content embeds those CRLFs as literal bytes on hunk lines;
# letting core.autocrlf normalize them to LF on commit corrupts the patch (it
# then fails to `git apply` against the actual CRLF-native source files). Treat
# these as opaque binary so git never touches their line endings.
patches/*.patch -text -diff
